tasks.description:
在 app/models/ 目录下创建 Note 模型，包含字段: id, title, content, created_at, updated_at。修改 app/models/__init__.py 添加 Note 模型的导入。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]
- PUT /notes/<id> (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/<id> -> {message: str}

在 app/routes/ 目录下创建 notes.py 路由文件，提供创建、读取、更新和删除笔记的 API。需要在 app/__init__.py 注册 notes_bp 蓝图。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]
- PUT /notes/<id> (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/<id> -> {message: str}

在 templates/ 目录下创建 notes.html 前端页面，用于显示和管理笔记列表。需要在 app/__init__.py 添加路由来显示该页面（如 @app.route('/notes')）。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}]
- PUT /notes/<id> (request: {title: str, content: str}) -> {id, title, content, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/<id> -> {message: str}

在 app/models/note.py 中为 Note 模型添加分类字段（如 category），并更新相关的 API 和数据库逻辑以支持按分类组织笔记。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str, category: str}) -> {id, title, content, category, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, category, created_at, updated_at}]
- PUT /notes/<id> (request: {title: str, content: str, category: str}) -> {id, title, content, category, created_at, updated_at}
